+---
+id: task-005-add-json-patch-creation
+type: task
+title: "Add JSON Patch creation"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implement and export `createPatch(from, to)` for RFC 6902 patch generation. The generated patch must
+reconstruct `to`, remain granular for local changes, use JSON Pointer escaping, and preserve the
+library's validation and immutability guarantees. Add tests and document the public API.
